# TokenStation5's Settings page changes the PS5's fan, clock boost, GPU
# memory and compute units through this one script, which checks every
# value against a fixed list. Members of the tokenstation group (the TV
# service's user, and desktop users added with
# "sudo adduser $USER tokenstation") may run it without a password.
%tokenstation ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/lib/tokenstation/hw
